SUMMARY:Family Support Group - Thursday Morning
DESCRIPTION:Weekly Virtual Family Support Group\, 11 am to 12:15 pm: This year-round group meets every Thursday morning via Zoom and is designed for family members (parents\, spouses and partners\, siblings\, adult offspring) of people with mental illness to gain support and perspective about mental illness in the family in a facilitated\, confidential discussion group. \nTo join\, contact Mel at mbryan@mhainspire.org.
